'''Lavender Coast''' was an [[:Category:Unreleased|unreleased]] [[Locations|location]] that was never opened to denizens of [[Sacred Grove]]. It would've been located to the far south of [[Lavender Coast Pass]], with the [[Warpstones|warpstone]] nearby which its entrance is blocked by barriers. Few official details were known about Lavender Coast.

The [[Elves|elf]] known as [[Chugzy]] also mentioned that harpies like [[Raven]] are native to Lavender Coast during the Heroes Journal [[Quests|quest]] titled, ''Raven, Lunatic''.

Like [[Silver Hills|other]] [[Black Forest|unreleased]] [[Glimmerdeep|locations]], Lavender Coast was never added to ''[[Free Realms]]'' before it was closed on March 31, 2014.

