==Trivia==
*Lavender Coast would have contained a lake of molten [[wikipedia:Lava|lava]], as seen through the [[wikipedia:Concept art|concept art]] by Edwin Rosell, and referenced through the in-game description of the purple [[Dragons|dragon]] [[Pet Pals|Pet Pal]], [[Embers]].
*It is unknown why Lavender Coast got its name when it is all lava lakes and volcanoes. It is possible that the ocean would've be viewable in the location, just like [[Seaside]], but it is separate between water and lava.

